  "description": "Hara gets handpicked to work as secretary to the CEO, \"trained\" by his own ambitious nephew, Han Seung-ho. It's a dangerous game of seduction and workplace politics - one that demands careful treading on Hara's part. But while she skillfully lays out the honey trap, she too seems to have her own cards up her sleeve. How does she manage to do it all? By selling whatever she has to sell.\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
